      "download_disabled": false,
      "description": "Each entry in the dataset is a JSON object and corresponds to a compound. The JSON format is based on a series of key-value pairs. The JSON keys and their corresponding value data types are:\n{\"id\":String}, {\"composition\":{String:Float},...},{\"formula\":String}, {\"space_group:String}, {\"pearson_symbol\":String}, {\"standard_enthalpy_formation\":[[String, Float],[String, Float]]}, {\"enthalpy_formation\":[[String, Float],[String, Float]]}, {\"ref_temp\":Int}, {\"uncertainty:{\u201cstandard_deviation\u201d:[[String, Float],[String, Float]]}, {\u201cstandard_error\u201d:[[String, Float],[String, Float]], \u201cexperimental_error\u201d:[[String, Float],[String, Float]]}, {\"notes\":String}, {\"citation\":String}, {\"calorimetry_method\":String}, {\"cas_reg_no:String}, {\"mp_id\":String}, {\"mp_formation_energy\":[[String, Float],[String, Float]]}, {\"mp_e_above_hull\":[[String, Float],[String, Float]]}, {\"oqmd_id\":String}, {\"oqmd_formation_energy\":[[String, Float],[String, Float]]}, {\"oqmd_e_above_hull\":[[String, Float],[String, Float]]}",
